------------------------------------------------
|       MolSurf 2.0 - Build/Installation       |
------------------------------------------------

MolSurf is built with CMake (>= 3.16). All native dependencies are now
provided by the host system / package manager instead of being vendored
under third-party/. Install them once for your OS, then run a normal
CMake build.

------------------------------------------------------------------
Dependencies
------------------------------------------------------------------
Required:
    Boost  (>= 1.66; components: thread, date_time, regex,
            filesystem, system, program_options)
    FFTW3  (double precision; threads recommended)
    CGAL   (with Core component; requires GMP and MPFR)
    LAPACK + BLAS

Optional / module-specific:
    NFFT3  (enables the FastSummation / CoarseGrain code path; if no
            system package is available the build will fall back to
            fetching and compiling NFFT 3.x from source -- this
            requires a POSIX shell and autotools at configure time)

------------------------------------------------------------------
Installing dependencies
------------------------------------------------------------------

Debian / Ubuntu:

    sudo apt-get install -y \
        build-essential cmake ninja-build pkg-config \
        libboost-all-dev \
        libfftw3-dev \
        libnfft3-dev \
        libcgal-dev libgmp-dev libmpfr-dev \
        liblapack-dev libblas-dev

macOS (Homebrew):

    brew install cmake ninja pkg-config \
        boost fftw cgal gmp mpfr lapack

    # NFFT is not in core Homebrew; MolSurf will build it from source
    # automatically (autotools is provided by Xcode's command-line tools).

Windows (vcpkg):

    vcpkg install \
        boost-thread boost-date-time boost-regex boost-filesystem \
        boost-system boost-program-options \
        fftw3 cgal gmp mpfr lapack

    # NFFT has no vcpkg port. Either disable NFFT-dependent modules or
    # use MSYS2 + `pacman -S mingw-w64-x86_64-nfft` and point CMake at it
    # with -DNFFT_INCLUDE_DIR / -DNFFT_LIBRARY.

------------------------------------------------------------------
Building
------------------------------------------------------------------

    cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    cmake --build build --parallel

On Windows, pass the vcpkg toolchain file:

    cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release ^
          -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=%VCPKG_ROOT%/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake

The MolSurf executable is produced under build/bin/.

------------------------------------------------------------------
Configuration options
------------------------------------------------------------------

    DISABLE_CGAL                    -- skip CGAL-dependent components
                                       (removes PocketTunnel).
    MOLSURF_NFFT_FORCE_FETCHCONTENT -- always build NFFT from source
                                       even if a system copy exists.
    MOLSURF_NFFT_VERSION            -- NFFT version to fetch (default 3.5.3).
